# Project

Project briefs for **__COURSE_CODE__** live in this folder: the midterm, the final, or another long piece of work.

**Grading criteria and weights: __LMS__ only.** Hand-in is on **__LMS__** unless the instructor says otherwise.

## How this folder is organized

```text
assignments/project/
  README.md
  midterm.md
  final.md
```

Add another markdown file here when the course has another project. Weekly labs stay in [`../labs/`](../labs/). Checkpoints stay in [`../checkpoints/`](../checkpoints/).

## How a project brief is organized

- The question the project asks
- What you produce
- Public data used (`data/public/`)
- How the work connects to the modules (`docs/modules/module-NN.md`)

## What belongs somewhere else

Weekly labs go in [`../labs/`](../labs/). Discussion posts and worksheets go in [`../checkpoints/`](../checkpoints/). Meeting plans go in [`docs/modules/`](../../docs/modules/). Sample files go in [`data/public/`](../../data/public/). Weights stay on **__LMS__**.

## Add the next project

Create `assignments/project/<name>.md` with the sections above. Use `midterm.md` or `final.md` when that is the piece of work.
